{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.fuyuko.solo",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "ソロステージ结束后的后台",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.fuyuko.solo",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.fuyuko.solo",
    "idolId": "fuyuko",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "speakerId": "fuyuko",
        "text": "～♪",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "ソロステージ辛苦了。心情很好啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "fuyuko",
        "text": "因为今天的ふゆ，状态绝佳！表演超棒的！",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "speakerId": "fuyuko",
        "text": "呐，怎么样？ふゆ的舞台！",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "当然，很好。",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "fuyuko",
        "text": "真的？比今天其他偶像的谁都好！？",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯，毫无疑问，冬優子是最好的。",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "fuyuko",
        "text": "果然！？你也这么想！？",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "fuyuko",
        "text": "ふゆ是……第一……",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（她笑得很真。这个笑容和现场那个不一样。）",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "fuyuko",
        "text": "啊……",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "fuyuko",
        "text": "……刚才那个，别跟别人说啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哪个？",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "fuyuko",
        "text": "就是，\"ふゆ是第一\"这种话，自己说得很起劲的这件事。",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（她别过脸去，耳朵是红的。）"
      }
    }
  },
  "annotations": [],
